date: 2025-08-28T00:00:00-04:00
---

The Sentience Distributor is a small arcane device that came with the radar dish taken from the roof of a roller rink. It spreads the signal the dish receives. It is fragile, and it is not known whether it was made for this particular use or is a general item that someone put to it. Anzu recognized it by name and asked to spend time with it alone.
